{"parse": {"title": "TWJ-01", "pageid": 40877, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TWJ-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/TWJ-02\" title=\"TWJ-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TWJ</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A5.B9.E6.9D.A5.E5.88.B0.E4.B9.8C.E5.93.88.E6.8B.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"她来到乌哈拉\">她来到乌哈拉</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 她来到乌哈拉</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Arriving in Juhalerat</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>弹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>场<span class=\"color-value\"></span>硝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>烟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>场<span class=\"color-value\"></span>并<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>愉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>快<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>险<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191001</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵沉重的脚步声经过长廊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚戴镣铐的先生被警卫押入房间，迟疑地坐上身后的木凳。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>审讯官抬手示意，警卫随即解下他的眼罩。光明来得太突然，就像记忆中灼目的烈日一般。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>强光刺痛了他，在这一瞬间，那位先生出乎本能地扭头向下，遮眼躲闪冷色的白光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>列兵阿历克塞·费奥多罗维奇·雷列耶夫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>年龄，二十四岁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>生于……噢，生于来亚什基，一个北方小伙儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>原第二北方大学法律系学生，于一九八二年取得对应学位后应征入伍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>四个月后，选调进入芝诺军备学院进修，并于毕业当年申请前往乌哈拉战区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>任芝诺军备学院驻乌哈拉第十五营七百五十六特遣队队员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>军衔，上等兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>服役时长，三个月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场机械得近乎无聊的例行公事，简述着受审之人的生平履历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿历克塞一一点头，用沉默回答着每一个提问与每一句陈述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着是他的罪行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>被控罪名是……枪杀战友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅰ：</div><div>相关罪行由本人自首供认，经特遣队队长贝托尔特少尉提交指控。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿历克塞：</div><div>……是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿历克塞：</div><div>我杀死了一位同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他开口应答，仅此一句。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaozoulang_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>这件事我本来不打算上报的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>但阿历克塞坚持要我这么做。他带着写好的报告来我办公室，把那摞该死的纸恭恭敬敬地放到我面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>“您只需要签字，然后把它报上去。长官。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>倒像是他作为我的上司在对我下命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>但我的士兵很诚实，他诚实得近乎执拗，我还能拿什么理由来拒绝他呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>嗯，这确实像他的作风：做了什么事，就该受什么罚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他对“正义”有种执着，像斗牛场上的野兽，盯着眼前那块红布拱个不停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>啊，雄壮有力，但却免不了一个被插满花标、力竭倒地的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两位证人站在审讯室外，隔着玻璃目视着屋内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿历克塞不动嘴唇，只以点头作答。窗外两人则等着自己被传讯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>马上就到我们了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>你我今天能站在这里，还算是走运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>……我明白，牺牲才是常态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人默契地看向屋内：另一位“走运的人”正在接受审讯，而与之相比，等在门外的证人倒更像是在坐牢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>什么时候才到我进去？这儿办事的效率这么低吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>还要等多久？要我像刚到乌哈拉那时候一样，傻兮兮地等在原地吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>安静，士兵，到你的时候自然有人来叫你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>战区就是这样，处处捉襟见肘，什么东西都不够用，别拿学院里那套做派往这儿放。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>“暴雨”让我们损失惨重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官没再把更多的话说出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如今的芝诺军备学院仿佛一栋被航弹炸毁的废楼，残破不堪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎只要再来一场大雨，便能将它彻底冲垮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>现在什么都缺。人员、物资、场地……情况不容乐观，但越是这种时候，我们的忠诚便越是闪耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>时局艰难，芝诺总部也得做出相应的反应。因此，我们才会被派到战区去干活儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>雇主开出的价码总是让人无法拒绝：资金、武装、场地和最重要的情报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>我们付出的，则是一些迟早要失去的“硬币”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只是沉默地望着玻璃里面的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>——比起训练场，还是战场更能锻炼新兵蛋子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官面色凝重，拍了拍身旁小家伙的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>毕竟人们总是要死的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>那阿历克塞会不会死？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>死刑？不会，你多虑了，隼崽儿。这事儿不算太严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他也许会被监禁三年，然后减刑、特赦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>总之有很多办法让他快点出来，现在人手紧缺，不能把年轻人白白耗在监狱里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>而且，我认为上将会对这个案子很感兴趣，别担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>他会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝托尔特话音未落，走廊前方的另一个房间中便走出一位书记员，朝红弩箭招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>看来是你先。去吧，隼崽儿，记得我跟你说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>对他们要毫无保留，要实话实说。为你好，也为阿历克塞和我好，去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>哼，我还以为我会被套个头套，然后锁上手铐脚镣，被人用靴子踢着押进去呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝托尔特：</div><div>你想要这个待遇？不难，现在拿枪崩掉我的脑袋就行了，当着警卫的面开枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭摆摆手，头也不回地进入了审讯室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-507501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-507501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-507501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>哈……你我的命还是留着好。回见，贝托尔特！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抽开椅子，跳着坐上去，翘起腿，双脚在桌下晃荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>红弩箭……嗯，请坐。别紧张，孩子，抽屉里有糖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>以及，请不要踢桌子，它可能顶不住你的“攻击”，红弩箭小姐。放松，放松，深呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>哦好，好。这儿有酒吗？还有，我不是“小姐”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>如果你问的是镇定类药物的话，很抱歉，就你的状态而言，我判断不需要呼叫医疗班。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>如果你要的是饮料，那杯子里有水。凉的，别嫌弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>算了，我们开始吧。开始，抓紧时间，来，同志，你有什么要问的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>列兵阿历克塞·费奥多罗维奇·雷列耶夫，在乌哈拉郊外执行搜救任务时枪杀了一位协从军战友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>你在现场，看见了事情发生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>是，我都看见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>其次，六月十二日，贝托尔特少尉指挥第七百五十六小队进入乌哈拉近郊山区，搜救一支被困的调查队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>根据贝托尔特少尉的报告，你作为志愿队员，临时加入了行动，是否属实？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>对。我去了，自愿的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>阿历克塞的口供和少尉提供的报告有一些出入，我们需要更多佐证，红弩箭同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很好，她喜欢这个称呼。现在她不是小姐了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>你问，我说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>我们只在某些地方提问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>现在把你知道的都跟我们说说，就从在乌哈拉落地的那时候开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">审讯官Ⅱ：</div><div>我们要知道详细的情况，要知道全部的情况和最真实的情况。我们要知道你的所见所闻，同志。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TWJ-01"}}